      "label": "text",
      "prov": [],
      "orig": "Ragas is your ultimate toolkit for evaluating and optimizing Large Language Model (LLM) applications. Say goodbye to time-consuming, subjective assessments and hello to data-driven, efficient evaluation workflows. Don't have a test dataset ready? We also do production-aligned test set generation.",
